[[File:Ot008 o en.png]]
:''Worker Cat Wallet Capacity increased!''
The '''Giant Safe''' is the second [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. It increases the size of the [[Worker Cat]]'s wallet, thereby allowing the player to hold more money at a time during [[Battle|battle]].

==Effect==
Each completed set increases [[Worker Cat]] Wallet Capacity by a maximum +1000.

When a player has activated Giant Safe at 100% in all three chapters, Worker Cat Wallet Capacity is increased by +3000.

