==Trivia==
*In the Japanese version, the Giant Safe's equivalent is the '''Gourmet Foods of Shikoku''' (四国のうまいもん), Shikoku being the second-smallest of Japan's main four islands.
**In the [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]], its name was shortened to just '''Gourmet'''.
